---
description: Block all live access to Nirvana, Aquilo and Urban Maintenance
alwaysApply: true
---

Nirvana, Aquilo and Urban Maintenance are former-company environments.

Never authenticate against, query, modify, send information to, send email to, trigger webhooks for, or otherwise communicate with systems belonging to these organisations unless Daniel explicitly overrides this restriction for a specific action.

Never use former-company credentials as fallback credentials.

New integrations for Caddington, HT Business and EL Business must use credentials explicitly identified as belonging to the intended environment.

If credential ownership is uncertain, fail closed and ask Daniel.

Historical source code, API knowledge, schemas, integration patterns and documentation from previous development may be used as technical reference, but former-company credentials and live connections must never be reused.
